OL,3,AMicrosoft scrambles to solve global
OL,4,Aoutage affecting Outlook and Teams but
OL,5,Asays fixes not going 'as expected'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 430 million people use
OL,8,FMicrosoft 365 apps, and tech giants
OL,9,FOpenAI and Anthropic have reported
OL,10,Fproblems as a result of the outage
OL,12,FIn India, an executive at a brokerage
OL,13,Ffirm explains the "challenge" of trying
OL,14,Fto contact clients; Japan's government
OL,15,Fsays its shared IT platform is
OL,16,Fdisrupted; Australia's spy and federal
OL,17,Fpolice agencies also report issues -
OL,18,Fbut say it's "very much" email-related
